-- TESTING -------------------------------------------------------------------
  Tested      NexClash differential verification against sixteen recordings;
              simulated boot on Sinclair's ROM and on a foreign ROM; run from
              its menu in OverSpec; Tang FPGA board: loads and plays.

  Replay      IDENTICAL on sixteen recordings (52,185 frames): every plot,
              erase, bomb, tile and score hook against the original, with 18
              broken builds detected. Enhanced differs from the default in the
              sprite patterns only (bank 11).

  Hardware    Tang Nano 20K FPGA build of the Next: loads with DivMMC automap
              on and plays

  Nothing here claims a result on real hardware unless the line above says so.

-- HOW TO USE ----------------------------------------------------------------
  Put this .nxc and the game file in the same folder on the Next's card and
  choose the .nxc in the Browser. See README.txt.
